#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "On the search page, open the <b>Comments</b> tab to search what people wrote in comments (a guild's own search has it too). Words, \"phrases\" and <code>-words</code> are looked for in the comment's text. These operators work on comments: <code>%(from_op)s</code>, <code>%(in_op)s</code> (where the comment is: its post's guild, topic or curation), <code>%(since)s</code>, <code>%(until)s</code>, <code>%(after)s</code>, <code>%(before)s</code>, <code>%(on)s</code>, <code>%(min_votes)s</code>, <code>%(is_ai)s</code> and <code>%(is_partnership)s</code>. The ones about a post's own content (<code>%(has)s</code>, <code>%(lang)s</code>, <code>%(domain)s</code>, <code>%(url)s</code>, <code>%(flair)s</code>, <code>%(is_forward)s</code>, <code>%(min_comments)s</code>) are left out with a note."
msgstr "Auf der Suchseite öffnen Sie die <b>Anmerkungen</b> Tab, um zu suchen, was die leute in kommentaren geschrieben haben (die eigene suche einer gilde hat es auch). Wörter, \"Phrasen\" und <code>-words</code> werden im Text des Kommentars gesucht. Diese Betreiber arbeiten an Kommentaren: <code>%(from_op)s</code>, <code>%(in_op)s</code> (wobei der Kommentar lautet: Gilde, Thema oder kuratierter Feed des Beitrags), <code>%(since)s</code>, <code>%(until)s</code>, <code>%(after)s</code>, <code>%(before)s</code>, <code>%(on)s</code>, <code>%(min_votes)s</code>, <code>%(is_ai)s</code> und <code>%(is_partnership)s</code>Die über den eigenen Inhalt eines Posts ()<code>%(has)s</code>, <code>%(lang)s</code>, <code>%(domain)s</code>, <code>%(url)s</code>, <code>%(flair)s</code>, <code>%(is_forward)s</code>, <code>%(min_comments)s</code>) werden mit einer Notiz ausgelassen."

